I am in my temporary room.
Today I am going to my new flat.
My big suitcase is on the floor.
Some of my clothes are on the bed.
I put those clothes in the suitcase.
Now the bed is empty.
I look inside the small cupboard.
My charger is kept there.
I put that charger in the bag.
My book is kept on the table.
I put that book near the bag.
I look under the bed.
There is nothing under the bed.
My laptop is on the desk.
I put that laptop in the backpack.
Now all the luggage is ready.
I zip up the suitcase.
This room is completely empty now.
I am ready for my new home.
